  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Smart City Infrastructure Project Plans For Visakhapatnam, through AECOM Technology Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant partially funds a Technical Assistance project to provide smart city master planning services for Visakhapatnam (Vizag) to the Municipal Administration and Urban Development Department, State Government of Andhra Pradesh. The TA is designed to promote the adoption of U.S. technologies and international best practices related to smart cities, and engage the process of planning discrete infrastructure projects to support the development of a more integrated smart city in Vizag.</narrative>
  </description>
